  file: /Users/cunxiy/Documents/research/autoresearch-eda/abc-harness/.autoeda/runtime/versions.md
  timeout_seconds: 600
  pass_condition: hypothesis, motivation, files, command, validation, benchmark results, correctness, review findings, commit, and next step are recorded
  fail_condition: missing or incomplete version log entry
- type: review_loop
  mode: configured_review_tool
  timeout_seconds: 600
  pass_condition: required review pass completes and accepted findings are addressed and revalidated
  fail_condition: skipped required review, unresolved accepted finding, or no revalidation
